{"src": "demo", "seq": 40000, "time": 1767457440000, "dt": "2026-01-04 00:24:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "有。查是你问它才给；想起来是没人问它也冒出来。后者难得多。", "len": 29, "topic": "日常", "noise": "", "arousal": 0.0, "heavy": 0.0, "human": 1.0, "wake": 0.5}
{"src": "demo", "seq": 40000, "time": 1767458040000, "dt": "2026-01-04 00:34:00", "role": "user", "text": "那先做查的吧，别一上来就太难", "len": 14, "topic": "日常", "noise": "", "arousal": 0.0, "heavy": 0.0, "human": 1.0, "wake": 0.5}
{"src": "demo", "seq": 80000, "time": 1767462180000, "dt": "2026-01-04 01:43:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "对。先跑通最小闭环，再谈好不好。", "len": 16, "topic": "日常", "noise": "", "arousal": 0.0, "heavy": 0.0, "human": 1.0, "wake": 0.5}
{"src": "demo", "seq": 60000, "time": 1767462960000, "dt": "2026-01-04 01:56:00", "role": "user", "text": "数据大概有五千条，会不会很慢", "len": 14, "topic": "日常", "noise": "", "arousal": 0.0, "heavy": 0.0, "human": 1.0, "wake": 0.5}
{"src": "demo", "seq": 80000, "time": 1767465780000, "dt": "2026-01-04 02:43:00", "role": "assistant", "text": "纯规则跑的话几秒。别用模型挨条打分，那个成本和条数成正比。", "len": 29, "topic": "日常", "noise": "", "arousal": 0.0, "heavy": 0.0, "human": 1.0, "wake": 0.5}
